title: "Words Are Not Containers: Relational Meaning Geometry in Language Models"
authors:
  - family-names: Singleton
    given-names: Mike
type: software
license: MIT
version: "0.9.3"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
repository-code: "https://github.com/singleton2787/words-are-not-containers"
abstract: >-
  Relational Meaning Geometry (RMG) measures, inside an open-weight language
  model and before it generates, whether the model has encoded the relation a
  prompt expresses. Includes the reproducibility suite, results, and working paper.
keywords:
  - interpretability
  - relational meaning geometry
  - hidden states
  - language models
  - pre-generation assurance
